        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(slack): use endsWith instead of includes for _all_ action_id matching",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`isBulkActionsBlock()` uses `el.action_id.includes(\"_all_\")` to detect bulk-action buttons. This has **two bugs**:\n\n1. **False positives**: Action IDs like `\"deploy_all_services\"` or `\"install_all_deps\"` contain the substring `_all_` and are incorrectly treated as bulk actions — their blocks are silently removed from Slack messages.\n2. **False negatives**: Legitimate bulk action IDs like `\"select_all\"` / `\"deselect_all\"` do **not** contain `_all_` (no trailing underscore), so `includes(\"_all_\")` fails to match them.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `interactions.block-actions.ts:293`: `includes(\"_all_\")` → `endsWith(\"_all\")`\n- `+1/-1` change\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Unit tests (53/53 passed):**\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  53 passed (53)\n```\n\n**Lint:** `npx oxlint` — no errors\n\n**Type check:** `pnpm tsgo` — no errors\n\n**Real behaviour proof (before vs after):**\n```\nLIN-66D8BD4EA2C\n2026年 07月 10日 星期五 14:00:34 CST\n\n=== Before vs After: isBulkActionsBlock ===\naction_id                    expected OLD includes(\"_all_\") NEW endsWith(\"_all\") OK?\nselect_all                   true       false                  true                 PASS\ndeselect_all                 true       false                  true                 PASS\ndeploy_all_services          false      true                   false                PASS\ninstall_all_deps             false      true                   false                PASS\nrecall_app                   false      false                  false                PASS\napprove_selected             false      false                  false                PASS\nopenclaw_cmdarg_0            false      false                  false                PASS\n\n--- Summary ---\nOLD includes(\"_all_\"): 2 false positives, 2 false negatives\nNEW endsWith(\"_all\"):  0 false positives, 0 false negatives\n```\n\n## Review\n\n- Manually reviewed and verified\n- AI-assisted: Yes",
